                        <p>O'Hara, M. (1995). <em>Market Microstructure Theory</em>. Blackwell Publishers.</p>
                        <p>Pardo, R. (2008). <em>The Evaluation and Optimization of Trading Strategies</em> (2nd ed.). John Wiley &amp; Sons.</p>
                        <p>Prado, M. L. de (2018). <em>Advances in Financial Machine Learning</em>. John Wiley &amp; Sons.</p>
                    </div>

